"name":"NH3 measurements and meteorological parameters from six miniaturized sensors and a Picarro NH3 analyzer collected at 1-minute intervals, Whim Bog, July to August 2024",
"@id": "https://catalogue.ceh.ac.uk/id/941b50a7-877e-48a9-921b-13003dfc1cd5",
"identifier": {"@id": "https://doi.org/10.5285/941b50a7-877e-48a9-921b-13003dfc1cd5"},
"citation":"Espina-Martín, P., Leeson, S.R., Nicoll, R., Pearson, C., Martin Hernandez, C., Mullinger, N.J., Yeung, K., Twigg, M., Deshpande, A., Jones, M.R., Braban, C.F., Costello, H., Spelman, G., Redon, N. (2026). NH3 measurements and meteorological parameters from six miniaturized sensors and a Picarro NH3 analyzer collected at 1-minute intervals, Whim Bog, July to August 2024. NERC EDS Environmental Information Data Centre. (Dataset). https://doi.org/10.5285/941b50a7-877e-48a9-921b-13003dfc1cd5",
